  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="preface">
        <div type="unit">
          <p><pb n="259"/>In nomine <persName ref="#new_person_Holytrinity">patris et filii et Spiritus
              sancti.</persName> Gloriosissimo et christianissimo <persName ref="#new_person_EmperorCharles">imperatori
              Karolo Augusto</persName>, verae religionis rectori ac defensori sanctae <persName
              ref="#new_person_god">Dei</persName> eclesiae, una cum prole sua eiusque fidelibus vita et salus, honor
            et benedictio cum victoria sine fine mansura.</p>
        </div>
        <div type="unit">
          <p>Almifice reverentiae vestrae patefacimus nos humillimi famuli ac missi vestri, <persName
              ref="#new_person_Hildibaldus">Hildibaldus</persName> scilicet sacri palatii archiepiscopus, <persName
              ref="#new_person_rihholfus">Rihholfus</persName> et <persName ref="#new_person_Arno">Arno</persName>
            archiepiscopi seu <persName ref="#new_person_Bernhard">Bernharius</persName>, una cum reliquis coepiscopis
            atque abbatibus et caetero clero, quia venimus secundum iussionem vestram in civitatem <placeName
              ref="#new_place_Mainz">Mogontiam</placeName> <gap reason="sampling"/></p>
        </div>
        <gap reason="sampling"/>
      </div>
      <div type="chapter" n="1">
        <head type="rubric"><pb n="261"/>De fide catholica firmiter retinenda.</head>
        <head type="number">Cap.I</head>
        <p>Initium enim actionis nostrae de fide esse decrevimus, quae bonorum est omnium fundamentum, et quia sine
          fide, <cit><ref><seg type="formula">ut dicit apostolus,</seg></ref> <quote source="HEB_11_6">inpossibile est
              placere <persName ref="#new_person_god">Deo</persName>.</quote></cit> Fides tamen indiget opere, quia
            <cit><quote source="JAM_2_26">fides sine operibus mortua est.</quote></cit>
          <cit><ref>Ideo beatus <persName ref="#new_person_greg">Gregorius</persName>:</ref> <quote><note
                type="source">Gregorius M., Homil. in evangel. I. II, 26 §9; Opp. I, 1557</note> Ille, inquit, vere
              credit, qui exercet operando quod credit.</quote></cit> <gap reason="sampling"/></p>
      </div>
      <div type="chapter" n="2">
        <head type="rubric">De spe habenda in <persName ref="#new_person_god">Deum</persName>.</head>
        <head type="number">Cap.II</head>
        <p>Spes vero in <persName ref="#new_person_god">Deum</persName> firmiter a cunctis Christianis tenenda est.
            <cit><ref><seg type="formula">Unde psalmista commemorat:</seg></ref> <quote source="PSA_61_9">Sperate in eo
              omnis congregatio populi et reliqua</quote></cit>, <cit><ref><seg type="formula">et
              iterum:</seg></ref> <quote source="PSA_36_3">Spera in <persName ref="#new_person_god">Domino</persName>
            et fac bonitatem</quote></cit>, <gap reason="sampling"/></p>
      </div>
      <gap reason="sampling"/>
